For unrelated repository work, do not invoke JY tools. For either entry phrase
below (with or without the space around `JY`), read and follow
`Quantum-Control-Applications-QuAM/Superconducting/JY_agent/AGENTS.md` and its
playbook, then use the project `jy_bringup` MCP server:

- `進入 JY 量測模式`: enter conversational measurement mode; each experiment
  or state change needs approval on the shared Dashboard.
- `進入 JY 自動量測模式`: enter bounded automatic mode; request one bounded
  lease approval, reply with the Dashboard and handoff, and end the turn. After
  the operator's `已核准`, wait for results with `jy_wait_for_autonomy_status`
  and stay inside its targets, nodes, quotas, and hard policies. Keep that agent
  run active while Cursor permits it; Cursor has no repository rule that can
  guarantee an indefinite model turn, so if the host pauses, resume from the
  same Dashboard and the operator's `已核准` message.

- `繼續JY自動量測模式` (aliases `繼續 JY 自動量測模式`, `Continue JY automatic measurement mode`): continue automatic mode on the open
  workflow with `jy_continue_autonomy_mode`. An expired or ended lease is
  renewed with its old scope (the Approval page shows only the renewal card:
  hours, full-auto judgement and code), a paused lease resumes, an active one
  is only reported. After a Recover the phrase starts a continuation workflow
  with the same simple card. Home "停止核准" ends the lease after the current
  run; `jy_wait_for_autonomy_status` follows the renewal (`superseded_lease_id`),
  so keep waiting and use the new `authorization.id`.

With full-auto judgement on, do not stop to ask the operator about a failed run:
record `repeat` and rerun; the server keeps the lease, closes this chip's stale
QM first and marks the node/qubit incomplete after two more failures; outages
resume by themselves. After 10 automatic decisions per lease, or while a
hardware lock is retained, the old pause returns; halts and expiry still go to
the operator.

Fast entry (operator 2026-10-19): on either entry phrase or the continue phrase,
run only Ensure and the matching `jy_enter_*` / `jy_continue_autonomy_mode` tool
before replying; read AGENTS.md and the playbook afterwards. Reply at once with
the bare `browser_url` and `operator_handoff.chat` as a three-item list, and
never poll for the lease approval. After an MCP reconnect, `已重新連線` /
`Reconnected` means: verify the new MCP process, then continue.

For both modes, show only the entry result's top-level `browser_url`. Approval,
controls, and all experiment results share that Dashboard service. The common
`/` entry links to the session Home, Approval, Experiment results, Token usage,
and Guide pages; do not enumerate those internal routes as separate websites.
The public URL is bare and has no bootstrap query. Browsers use the fixed ignored
`JY_agent/runtime/dashboard-password.txt`; never create device-pairing links.

While measurement mode is open, any paused turn must copy `operator_handoff.chat`
verbatim as a three-item markdown list, never as one paragraph, so the operator
always sees what to do, which exact phrase to send afterwards, and
`如需結束量測，請於網頁首頁結束量測後再對話輸入「結束量測」。`
Successful entry shows only the top-level `browser_url`. After the operator
sends `已核准` or `Approved`, the next reply starts with exactly `已核准`.
A live turn may execute `結束量測` directly; a paused or disconnected turn
needs Dashboard Home shutdown first, then `結束量測` to verify.

Treat `進入JY量測模式` and `進入JY自動量測模式` as identical aliases.
Also treat `Enter JY measurement mode` and `Enter JY automatic measurement mode`
as exact English aliases.

The root `jy_agent.ps1 -Action Stdio` launcher finds the nested agent relative to
this workspace; the repository folder itself may have any name. It initializes
only the MCP protocol. On an entry phrase, run `.\jy_agent.ps1 -Action Ensure`
before the entry tool so the Dashboard is ready. If Ensure returns
`recovery_only`, do not
call an entry tool or publish a URL; direct the on-site operator to the loopback
recovery console. If MCP is unavailable, do not claim that measurement mode
started or keep retrying Ensure: run the root Doctor
action, then ask the user to enable/trust and reload this repository-root project
MCP configuration, not to reopen the `JY_agent` subfolder.

For configured stop/exit phrases, persist full shutdown, cooperatively stop and
poll any active JY run, leave or quarantine the workflow, and run `powershell
-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\jy_agent.ps1 -Action Stop`. A
retained lock stays available only for local recovery and does not keep the
Dashboard/MCP/tunnel alive once the worker has exited. Never approve for the user, directly execute a
calibration script, write `state.json`, or bypass JY policy and hardware locks.

In JY context, `恢復` / `Recover` runs repository-root
`.\jy_agent.ps1 -Action Recover`; it closes stale workflow/process state without
depending on the MCP, deleting a retained lock, or killing an unverified
process. Recognized instrument-connectivity failures pause scheduling and are
reported on the Dashboard. After on-site inspection, `恢復量測` / `Resume
measurement` calls `jy_resume_measurement_mode` for the same workflow/session;
the current node restarts as a new run. Under full-auto judgement the server
resumes the same lease by itself after a successful QOP probe; keep waiting
with `jy_wait_for_autonomy_status`. A retained hardware lock blocks this
resume and still requires local recovery. See
`Quantum-Control-Applications-QuAM/Superconducting/JY_agent/Command.md` for the
complete bilingual aliases.
